 n argument: the enraged father bursts into the room and destroys the play. 
 Years later\, the protagonist becomes a father himself and discovers the ol
 d figurines. Together with his son\, he continues the story that was once i
 nterrupted. "Shadows of Childhood" is a film about a choice: to pass on to 
 the next generation the pain experienced or the love that was once lacking.
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1766895
END:VEVENT
