 Director: Natalya Savras\nGenre: Documentary\n\nVasily Viktorovich from the
  village of Lopaevo can trace his family lineage back 13 generations. Every
  one of his ancestors was recorded in official documents as a Vogul\, the h
 istorical name for the people now known as the Mansi. Yet Novaya Lyalya Dis
 trict in Sverdlovsk Region\, where the Lopaev family has lived and farmed f
 or centuries\, is not officially recognized as a traditional territory of R
 ussia's Indigenous peoples of the North. How did this happen\, and what wil
 l Vasily Viktorovich do about it?
